  "summary": "Software Developer at Fundstrat Global Advisors based in New York City. Lead developer of full stack development of Fundstrat AI, an AI powered tool for our RIA clients. \nDeployed a fresh EC2 instance to host Fundstrat AI, configured server for production.\nLeveraging LLM Agents to connect our database to our robust chart generator to produce high quality charts that clients can use in their chart books to send to their own clients.\nUtilizing agentic structures to create a report writing agent powered by RAG embeddings and LLM agents.",
