    "description": "Developed a full-stack CPI charting tool with an interactive Highcharts frontend and a Python data scraping pipeline. The application displayed headline CPI as a trend line over a stacked component breakdown, allowing users to explore how individual categories contributed to inflation over time. I built a hierarchical drill-down table for navigating CPI categories and implemented real-time re-aggregation so the visualization stayed accurate and readable as users adjusted the displayed categories. On the backend, I created scheduled jobs to regularly pull CPI series and relative-importance weights from BLS sources and refresh the dataset automatically.",
